# The Road to Aht Urhgan (jeuno 91): option 3 without the gil. A level 75 Warrior with 499999 gil, Prog 1 by a GM
# while available: 10063, finished 3: begun (the available finish), the gil check fails: nothing else (Prog 1).
# Accepted: 10064, finished 3: nothing.
lists LowerJeuno/Faursel/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10063 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10064
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=39.5,4.1,-45.2 job=WAR lvl=75 gil=499999
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 1
login
trigger Faursel                     # available, Prog 1: 10063
finish option=3                     # begun; 499999 < 500000: no purchase
trigger Faursel                     # accepted, Prog 1: 10064
finish option=3                     # no purchase: nothing
